      "text": "Teams write session-scoped files under .kkirikkiri/teams/{team_name}/ (TEAM_PLAN.md, TEAM_PROGRESS.md, TEAM_FINDINGS.md, report.md), while saved teams persist cross-session under .kkirikkiri/shared/saved-teams/."
